          "description": "Take to the streets with the PAW Patrol in five action-filled stories. When fires spark, Marshall, Chase, Rubble, Zuma, Skye, and Rocky are ready to race to the rescue! From BBQ fires and flaming boats to smouldering s'mores, these brave pups are fired up to save the day!   \n\nStories include:    \n- Pups Save the Big BBQ     \n- Pups Save the Flaming Flounder   \n- Pups Make the News    \n- Pups Save a Baby Goat Birthday!    \n- Pups Save a S’more-mergency",
